  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br>Experience the best of Inlet Beach at this stylish 3-bedroom, 3.5-bathroom vacation rental! This spacious home offers a fully equipped kitchen, two living areas with Smart TVs, and a dedicated workspace. Relax by the shared outdoor pool, grill on the private patio, or unwind by the fire pit. Just minutes from the beach, local dining, and scenic trails, this home is perfect for families or groups looking to explore Florida’s Emerald Coast.<br><br>The Space:<br>Location perks:<br>Inlet Beach (0.5 miles), 30A Shopping Center (0.7 miles), Rosemary Beach (1.3 miles), Alys Beach (2.1 miles), Camp Helen State Park (3.6 miles), Pier Park (9.7 miles), Gayle's Trails (8.8 miles) <br><br>Interior:<br>— Kitchen (drip coffee maker, keurig, crockpot, toaster, cooking utensils, tableware)<br>— Smart TVs <br>— Split-type ductless A/C & heating in every room<br>— Free WiFi<br>— Full-size washer and dryer<br>— 2,065 sq. ft.<br><br>Exterior:<br>— Fire pit<br>— Gas grill<br>— Private patio and balcony<br>— Shared outdoor pool<br>— Backyard dining (seating for 6)<br>— On-site driveway parking for 4 vehicles<br><br>Floor Configuration:<br>Main floor: Living room, kitchen, dining area, half bathroom, laundry area<br>Second floor: 1 bedroom (queen bed, en-suite bathroom), 1 bedroom (king bed, en-suite bathroom, smart TV) dedicated workspace, balcony access<br>Third floor: 1 bedroom (king bed), loft area with 2 twin-over-twin bunk beds, 1 full bathroom<br><br>Guest Access:<br>Guests have full access to the entire home, including all indoor and outdoor spaces. The shared pool is available for use, and a digital lock provides easy self-check-in.<br><br>The Neighborhood:<br>Nestled in the charming Inlet Beach area, this home provides easy access to the white sandy beaches of 30A. Spend your days exploring nearby Rosemary Beach or Alys Beach, both known for their coastal charm, boutique shopping, and award-winning dining. Outdoor lovers can enjoy hiking at Camp Helen State Park or paddleboarding in Lake Powell Park.<br><br>Getting Around:<br>A car is recommended for exploring the area, but biking along 30A is also a popular option. The nearest airport is Northwest Florida Beaches International Airport (ECP), located 20 miles away. Ride-share services like Uber and Lyft are available.<br><br>Other Things to Note:<br>— No street parking allowed. Guests must use the driveway.<br><br>Interaction with Guests:<br>We are offsite but available when needed. Please message us through the app or booking platform for the quickest response.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
